# Stage 2/3 far layer (factor 3/16 ~ 0.2, y = 0): the Schafberg across the
# Wolfgangsee seen from St. Gilgen - the long lit west ridge f rising to the
# summit (x 300) with the tiny summit hotel (h wall, F roof), the sheer east
# face in shadow F with lit f buttresses, the Spinnerin ridge falling east,
# low forested hills wrapping round. Colours f F h only (art-style 7); the
# foot dithers f/h into h haze (hidden behind the mid layer). Drawn by the
# pixel-artist with a throwaway script; the grid below is the source.
sprite = bg_schafberg
size   = 640x140
origin = 0,0
anim   = idle frames=1
---
frame idle 0
